{
  "uid": "shopsense-slo",
  "title": "ShopSense / SLOs and alerts",
  "description": "Service level objectives for POST /support, burn rates, and the state of every alert rule.",
  "tags": [
    "shopsense"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "shopsense"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "title": "ShopSense dashboards",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What is an SLO? (and what you are looking at)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "An **SLO** is a promise about quality, measured over time. Ours covers the customer-facing endpoint `POST /support`:\n\n- **Availability SLO:** 99% of requests succeed (no 5xx).\n- **Latency SLO:** 95% of requests finish within 60 seconds.\n\nThe **error budget** is the failure the promise allows (1% and 5%). The **burn rate** says how fast we are using it: **1 = exactly on pace**, **14.4 = we would use 2% of a month's budget in one hour**. Alerts fire on high burn rates, not on single errors. The numbers below use the dashboard's time range, so widen it (top right) for a steadier picture. Rules live in `infra/rules/slo.yml`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Availability: share of requests that succeeded",
      "description": "Target: 99% or more over the selected range.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "1 - (sum(increase(http_requests_total{job=\"gateway\", route=\"/support\", status=~\"5..\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / sum(increase(http_requests_total{job=\"gateway\", route=\"/support\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Availability error budget left",
      "description": "100% = no failures. 0% = budget fully spent. Negative = promise broken.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "1 - ((1 - (1 - (sum(increase(http_requests_total{job=\"gateway\", route=\"/support\", status=~\"5..\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / sum(increase(http_requests_total{job=\"gateway\", route=\"/support\"}[$__range])))) / 0.01)",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latency: share of requests within 60 s",
      "description": "Target: 95% or more. Computed from the histogram bucket le=60.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"gateway\", route=\"/support\", le=~\"60(\\\\.0)?\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(http_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"gateway\", route=\"/support\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.95
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
